# Demo buy card

$ Achat d\'un pack

> register jeanFamille 5251896983 ADULT
EXPECT: Customer{id='4', name='jeanFamille', category='ADULT', creditCard=*}

> add-to-cart jeanFamille FAMILY_PLAN 1
EXPECT: 1xFAMILY_PLAN

> validate-cart jeanFamille
EXPECT: CliOrder[id=4, customerId=4, price=30.0, payReceiptId=RECEIPT:*, status=VALIDATED]

$ Scan de carte de toute la famille (enfant et adultes)

> scan-card gate1 4
EXPECT: Sound: High sound
> scan-card gate1 5
EXPECT: Sound: High sound
> scan-card gate1 6
EXPECT: Sound: Low sound
> scan-card gate1 7
EXPECT: Sound: Low sound
